Automatic radio power help

Opening announces the saved setting.
o or full stop) Next choice. Comma) Previous choice.
Choices are Off, Start only, Stop only, and Start and stop.
Start wakes the selected saved radio at startup if its control port is visible.
Stop switches off the selected radio when you confirm quitting YAC.
Power control works on supported radios.
h) Read this help.
q) Keep the choice and return to Settings.

